    "text": "A particle of mass $m$ is attached to three identical massless springs of spring constant ' $k$ ' as shown in the figure. The time period of vertical oscillation of the particle is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/hA0zxfPnEdI2XfsxtV7Ur2SgrGSmOkCpvMmSIz-W3Ns.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
